[00:03.38]1. Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[00:28.76]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[00:29.00]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[00:29.00]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[00:29.16]By his love God made provision;
[01:02.64]We may freely take his hand.
[01:51.84]So we make our dedication;
[01:51.84]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[02:11.94]2. In this day of Satan’s anger,
[02:51.54]As the end is drawing ever near,
[02:51.64]We are faced with opposition
[02:51.66]That could make us turn away in fear.
[02:51.73]But Jehovah gives protection;
[02:51.73]Close to him we want to stay,
[02:51.73]That we might forever serve him.
[02:51.73]Love him loyally, never stray.
[02:51.73]3. Help for us God has provided
[02:51.73]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[02:51.73]Through the Christian congregation,
[02:51.73]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[02:51.73]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[02:51.73]He will help us do what’s right.
[02:51.73]He will help us to be loyal
[02:51.73]And walk modestly in his sight.
